"切换窗口" = "Switch Windows";
"没有可切换的窗口" = "No windows to switch to";
"Tab 下一个     ⇧Tab 上一个     松开 ⌘ 切换     Esc 取消" = "Tab Next     ⇧Tab Previous     Release ⌘ to switch     Esc Cancel";
"松开 ⌘ 切换     Esc 取消" = "Release ⌘ to switch     Esc Cancel";
"第 %d / %d 页" = "Page %d of %d";
